{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/Shepherd-Knight-02-herding-dog.gif?t=1750011025\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shepherd Knight is a game that places you in the role of a fearless shepherdess, a member of a noble order of shepherd knights. With your faithful dog by your side, your mission is to herd, guide, and protect your sheep while facing numerous challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/Shepherd-Knight-01-Sheeps.gif?t=1750011025\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Path of Legacy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a mystical world filled with forgotten ruins, ancient temples, and sacred lands. Guide your magical flock and loyal dog through breathtaking landscapes as you uncover relics and secrets of an order that saw sheep as guardians of spiritual balance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/Shepherd-Knight-04-panel-lore.gif?t=1750011025\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Shield and the Flock</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defend your flock against relentless threats drawn to their magic. Wield your sword, command your companion, and face the dangers of a world where protecting your herd means preserving the legacy of the Shepherd Knights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/Shepherd-Knight-03-wolf.gif?t=1750011025\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Trials of the Shepherd Knights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve ancient puzzles tied to the sacred bond between shepherd, flock, and companion. Unlock hidden paths, recover lost memories, and piece together the forgotten story of a legendary order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/Shepherd-Knight-05-puzzle.gif?t=1750011025\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2700790?t=1750011025","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2700790?t=1750011025","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/94ba3801b3ace8218815a1e6c66377d466acc5de/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750011025","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/94ba3801b3ace8218815a1e6c66377d466acc5de/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750011025","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/Shepherd-Knight-02-herding-dog.gif?t=1750011025\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shepherd Knight is a game that places you in the role of a fearless shepherdess, a member of a noble order of shepherd knights. With your faithful dog by your side, your mission is to herd, guide, and protect your sheep while facing numerous challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/Shepherd-Knight-01-Sheeps.gif?t=1750011025\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Path of Legacy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a mystical world filled with forgotten ruins, ancient temples, and sacred lands. Guide your magical flock and loyal dog through breathtaking landscapes as you uncover relics and secrets of an order that saw sheep as guardians of spiritual balance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/Shepherd-Knight-04-panel-lore.gif?t=1750011025\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Shield and the Flock</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defend your flock against relentless threats drawn to their magic. Wield your sword, command your companion, and face the dangers of a world where protecting your herd means preserving the legacy of the Shepherd Knights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/Shepherd-Knight-03-wolf.gif?t=1750011025\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Trials of the Shepherd Knights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve ancient puzzles tied to the sacred bond between shepherd, flock, and companion. Unlock hidden paths, recover lost memories, and piece together the forgotten story of a legendary order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/Shepherd-Knight-05-puzzle.gif?t=1750011025\" /></div></p>","developers":["Cadabra Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/5d13d6d515ab59de27906cee1215dd0467a63ad0/header.jpg?t=1750011025","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Shepherd Knight","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimu